    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d322">

                <pb facs="0420" n="410" sameAs="frus:frus1944v02/pg410"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.796/740</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Canadian Embassy to the
                            Department of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi>
                </p>
                <p>With its memorandum of February 7th the Canadian Embassy enclosed copies of a
                    memorandum outlining the matters which, in the view of the Canadian Government,
                    might fall within the scope of a multilateral air transport convention.</p>
                <p>Enclosed for the confidential information of the United States Government are
                    eight copies of the draft of such a convention.<anchor n="53" xml:id="d322-f1"/>
                    This draft is a tentative and provisional statement of the policy of the
                    Canadian Government.</p>
                <p>The Canadian Government is most anxious to receive at an early date the
                    preliminary views of the United States Government on the general subject of
                    postwar civil aviation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1944-03-11">March 11,
                            1944</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d322-f1" n="53" xml:id="d322-f1-content">
                <p>For text of the draft international air transport convention, see Canada, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">House of Commons Debates</hi>, vol. 82, No. 33, pp.
                    1626–1633.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
